 "source_instruction": "i am looking for wide leg black color bell bottom flare jegging sweatpants, but size in small",
 "query": "I stopped by the community garden on my walk over here this morning, y\u2019know? The old sunflower patch that the local elementary kids planted back in spring is finally fully bloomed, heads so heavy with seeds they\u2019re drooping almost all the way down to the mulch, and there were half a dozen chubby goldfinches hopping from stalk to stalk pecking at the centers like they owned the place. I even paused for ten whole minutes to watch one little fledgling that kept fumbling its landing, flapping its fuzzy little wings so hard it would nearly tip right off the flower head every time it tried to settle, and a couple of the parent birds kept darting over like they were coaching it not to face-plant into the dirt. It was such a nice, silly little detour that I almost forgot I popped out to run a quick errand in the first place. Hey, can you help me find some women\u2019s jeans? I\u2019m looking for pairs with a bell bottom cut, I want to grab a pair and a matching canvas belt black, and they need to be under $20 total, oh and make sure they have reinforced belt loops too, I hate when those tear after a couple wears. I don\u2019t want anything super low-rise, just regular rise is fine for what I need.",
